  "policyTermsBody": "WHO THIS IS FOR\nStudafy is for teachers, students and parents. There is no school administrator in this version of the app. By signing in you accept these terms and the Privacy Policy.\n\nYOUR ACCOUNT\nSign in with Google, Microsoft or Apple and keep that account secure. You can add several accounts to one device; sign out on a device you share. A parent may create an account for a child with no email or phone, accepts these terms for the child, and is responsible for how it is used. Do not impersonate anyone.\n\nUSE IT PROPERLY\nUse Studafy only for learning, teaching and school communication. Do not bully, harass or threaten anyone, share sexual, violent, hateful or unlawful content, upload files you have no right to share, try to see records that are not yours, or hand in someone else's work - or AI output - as your own. You can report or block anyone from inside the app. We may remove content and suspend accounts that break these rules.\n\nTEACHERS\nYou are responsible for the marks and attendance you record. Marks are drafts until you publish them. A published mark is changed only by correcting it with a reason, and the old mark is kept. Attendance changes after the lesson's day need a reason; after seven days only the class's lead teacher can change a register. Give students more time or reopen work with a reason. Files you replace or remove are kept for the school. Share only what you have the right to share.\n\nSTUDENTS\nHand in your own work. You can replace it until the deadline, which is in your school's time zone; earlier hand-ins are kept. After the deadline, or once a mark is published, you need your teacher's permission to hand in again. If a mark or attendance record looks wrong, ask your teacher.\n\nPARENTS\nYou can link to your child only with their approval, unless you created their account. You can see published marks, attendance, work and class material, and hand work in for a young child. You cannot change marks or attendance, and you do not see your child's private messages. Family+ is your own paid plan: one plan covers up to 4 linked children, a larger one up to 8, in the order you linked them. It summarises what you can already see, compares a child only with their own earlier record, and predicts nothing.\n\nYOUR CONTENT\nYou keep the rights in what you write and upload. You let us store and show it only to run Studafy for you and your school. Work handed in, marks, attendance and shared files become part of the school's records.\n\nAI STUDY TOOLS\nThey are optional and can be wrong. Check what they produce and never hand it in as your own work. AI never marks work. Daily and monthly limits apply.\n\nSUBSCRIPTIONS\nLessons, notebooks, work, marks and attendance are free. Studafy Plus and Studafy Max are for students; Family+ is for parents, for up to 4 or up to 8 linked children. All are billed monthly by Apple or Google at the price the store shows until you cancel in your store account, where refunds are also handled.\n\nMEETINGS\nStudafy does not host video calls. Meeting links open in Google Meet under Google's terms.\n\nCHANGES AND ENDING\nWe may change or withdraw features, and will tell you before a change to these terms that affects you. You can delete your account in Account settings and cancel within 14 days. Records the school must keep stay with the school.",
